# ML-DSA-65 (FIPS 204) public half of the Glyndor release key, read by
# scripts/admit/admit.py to check <package>.mldsa65.sig beside <package>.sig.
#
# One base64 key per line, the raw 1952-byte public key, the same shape as
# glyndor-release-ed25519.b64. Two lines during a rotation overlap; a signature
# made by either is accepted. Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are
# ignored.
#
# No key is configured yet, so no product signs with one. While this file holds
# no key, a release that does attach a .mldsa65.sig is refused: a signature the
# channel cannot check is not treated as one that passed.
